{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_29_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_29","textTraditional":"一、十有八年，春，王正月，公會齊侯於濼，公與夫人姜氏遂如齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_29_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_29","textTraditional":"濼之會，不言及夫人何也？以夫人之伉，弗稱數也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_29_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_29","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，丙子，公薨於齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_29_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_29","textTraditional":"其地，於外也。薨稱公，舉上也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_29_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_29","textTraditional":"三、丁酉，公之喪至自齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_29_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_29","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_29_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_29","textTraditional":"五、冬，十有二月，己丑，葬我君桓公。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_29_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_29","textTraditional":"葬我君，接上下也。君弒，賊不討，不書葬。此其言葬何也？不責踰國而討於是也。桓公葬而後舉謚，謚，所以成德也，於卒事乎加之矣。知者慮，義者行，仁者守，有此三者備，然後可以會矣。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}